{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And I have given, etc.</b> Five times 'the children of Israel' are mentioned in this verse, to make known their belovedness — that their pronouns are repeated in one verse corresponding to the count of the five books of the Torah. And thus I have seen in Bereshit Rabbah." "<b>And there shall be no plague among the children of Israel.</b> That they need not approach the sanctuary — for if they approach, there will be a plague."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:58.596294273Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}